#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_none.rst:5
msgid "Select none"
msgstr "取消选择"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_none.rst:7
msgid ""
"To be sure that any object is selected before any action, QElectroTech "
"provides the option to unselect all objects from the `workspace`_. This "
"option is useful for avoiding undesired changes such as the `properties from"
" an element`_."
msgstr ""
"要确定任何对象在动作之前被选中，QElectroTech 提供了从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中取消选择所有对象的选项。 "
"此选项对于避免诸如 `属性从元件 <properties from an element_>`_ 中进行不想要的更改是有用的 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_none.rst:11
msgid "The unselecting of objects can only be done from `menu bar`_."
msgstr "不选择对象只能从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 进行。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_none.rst:13
msgid "Select **Edit > Select none** to unselect all selected object."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > 选择无** 取消所有选定对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_none.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"
